[2m2025-10-12T18:23:18.192923Z[0m [32m INFO[0m FunctionCall: shell({"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/001-speckit-specify-wechat/contracts/catalog.openapi.json\n{\n  \"openapi\": \"3.0.1\",\n  \"info\": {\n    \"title\": \"Theme Catalog API\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"/themes\": {\n      \"get\": {\n        \"summary\": \"List available story themes\",\n        \"operationId\": \"listThemes\",\n        \"parameters\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"q\",\n            \"in\": \"query\",\n            \"description\": \"Keyword applied to title, description, and tags\",\n            \"schema\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 50 }\n          },\n          {\n            \"name\": \"tag\",\n            \"in\": \"query\",\n            \"description\": \"Filter to a single tag\",\n            \"schema\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 20 }\n          },\n          {\n            \"name\": \"favorites\",\n            \"in\": \"query\",\n            \"description\": \"Comma-separated list of themeIds marked as favorite (used to annotate response)\",\n            \"schema\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n          }\n        ],\n        \"responses\": {\n          \"200\": {\n            \"description\": \"Catalog themes\",\n            \"content\": {\n              \"application/json\": {\n                \"schema\": {\n                  \"type\": \"object\",\n                  \"required\": [\"catalogVersion\", \"themes\"],\n                  \"properties\": {\n                    \"catalogVersion\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n                    \"themes\": {\n                      \"type\": \"array\",\n                      \"items\": { \"$ref\": \"#/components/schemas/Theme\" }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"components\": {\n    \"schemas\": {\n      \"Theme\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"themeId\", \"title\", \"description\", \"tags\", \"lastUpdated\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"themeId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"title\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"description\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"maxLength\": 120 },\n          \"tags\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n            \"maxItems\": 5\n          },\n          \"lastUpdated\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\" },\n          \"isFavorite\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\n"],"workdir":"/Users/xinge/Desktop/project/Try_4th"})
[2m2025-10-12T18:23:30.584078Z[0m [32m INFO[0m FunctionCall: shell({"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/001-speckit-specify-wechat/contracts/stories.openapi.json\n{\n  \"openapi\": \"3.0.1\",\n  \"info\": {\n    \"title\": \"Interactive Story API\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"/stories\": {\n      \"post\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Start a new story session\",\n        \"operationId\": \"startStory\",\n        \"requestBody\": {\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"content\": {\n            \"application/json\": {\n              \"schema\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"required\": [\"themeId\"],\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"themeId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n                  \"clientVersion\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Mini program version string\" }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"responses\": {\n          \"200\": {\n            \"description\": \"Initial story turn\",\n            \"content\": {\n              \"application/json\": {\n                \"schema\": { \"$ref\": \"#/components/schemas/StoryTurnResponse\" }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"400\": { \"description\": \"Unsupported theme or invalid payload\" }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"/stories/{sessionId}/turns\": {\n      \"post\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Submit a player choice and retrieve the next turn\",\n        \"operationId\": \"advanceStory\",\n        \"parameters\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"sessionId\",\n            \"in\": \"path\",\n            \"required\": true,\n            \"schema\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"uuid\" }\n          }\n        ],\n        \"requestBody\": {\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"content\": {\n            \"application/json\": {\n              \"schema\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"required\": [\"selectedOption\"],\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"selectedOption\": {\n                    \"type\": \"integer\",\n                    \"minimum\": 1,\n                    \"maximum\": 4\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"responses\": {\n          \"200\": {\n            \"description\": \"Next story turn or ending\",\n            \"content\": {\n              \"application/json\": {\n                \"schema\": { \"$ref\": \"#/components/schemas/StoryTurnResponse\" }\n              }\n            }\n          },\n          \"400\": { \"description\": \"Invalid option or session expired\" }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"components\": {\n    \"schemas\": {\n      \"StoryTurnResponse\": {\n        \"type\": \"object\",\n        \"required\": [\"sessionId\", \"turnIndex\", \"narrative\", \"ending\"],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"sessionId\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"uuid\" },\n          \"turnIndex\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0 },\n          \"narrative\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n          \"options\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n            \"maxItems\": 4,\n            \"description\": \"Present when ending=false\"\n          },\n          \"ending\": { \"type\": \"boolean\" },\n          \"moderationMessage\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"description\": \"Present when content blocked\" }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\n"],"workdir":"/Users/xinge/Desktop/project/Try_4th"})
[2m2025-10-12T18:23:39.594371Z[0m [32m INFO[0m FunctionCall: shell({"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/001-speckit-specify-wechat/contracts/telemetry.openapi.json\n{\n  \"openapi\": \"3.0.1\",\n  \"info\": {\n    \"title\": \"Story Telemetry API\",\n    \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"/telemetry/turns\": {\n      \"post\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Submit telemetry for a story turn\",\n        \"operationId\": \"submitTurnTelemetry\",\n        \"requestBody\": {\n          \"required\": true,\n          \"content\": {\n            \"application/json\": {\n              \"schema\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"required\": [\"sessionIdHash\", \"themeId\", \"turnIndex\", \"latencyMs\", \"outcome\"],\n                \"properties\": {\n                  \"sessionIdHash\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n                  \"themeId\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n                  \"turnIndex\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0 },\n                  \"latencyMs\": { \"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0 },\n                  \"outcome\": {\n                    \"type\": \"string\",\n                    \"enum\": [\"success\", \"handled_error\", \"moderated\"]\n                  },\n                  \"timestamp\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"format\": \"date-time\" }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"responses\": {\n          \"202\": { \"description\": \"Telemetry accepted for processing\" },\n          \"400\": { \"description\": \"Invalid telemetry payload\" }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\nEOF\n"],"workdir":"/Users/xinge/Desktop/project/Try_4th"})
[2m2025-10-12T18:23:52.715800Z[0m [32m INFO[0m FunctionCall: shell({"command":["bash","-lc","cat <<'EOF' > specs/001-speckit-specify-wechat/quickstart.md\n# Quickstart: WeChat Text Adventure Mini Program\n\n## Prerequisites\n- Node.js 18.x and npm 9+\n- WeChat Developer Tools installed locally\n- Access credentials for Tencent COS bucket containing theme `.txt` files\n- DeepSeek API key configured for backend proxy service\n\n## 1. Install Dependencies\n```bash\nnpm install --prefix backend\n```\n\n## 2. Configure Environment\nCreate `backend/.env` with:\n```\nPORT=8080\nCOS_BUCKET=weapp-story-themes\nCOS_REGION=ap-shanghai\nCOS_ACCESS_KEY=your-key\nCOS_SECRET=your-secret\nDEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-deepseek-api-key\nTELEMETRY_ENDPOINT=https://metrics.internal.example/v1/ingest\nSESSION_TTL_MINUTES=30\n```\n\n## 3. Seed Theme Index (Optional for local testing)\n```bash\nnpm run --prefix backend seed:themes\n```\nThis script uploads sample theme metadata and prompts to the COS bucket and generates the catalog index JSON.\n\n## 4. Run Backend Locally\n```bash\nnpm run --prefix backend dev\n```\nThis starts the Fastify server with live reload and mocked DeepSeek responses when `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` is not set.\n\n## 5. Configure Mini Program\n- Open WeChat Developer Tools and select \"Import Project\".\n- Choose `src/mini-program` as the project directory.\n- Set the request domain whitelist to include `http://localhost:8080`.\n- Update `src/mini-program/utils/api.js` to point to the backend base URL if not already set.\n\n## 6. Run Tests (Test-First)\n```bash\nnpm test --prefix backend         # Backend unit + contract tests\nnpm run test:simulate --prefix src/mini-program  # Simulated mini program tests\n```\nAll tests should fail initially until implementation is complete, per Test-First principle.\n\n## 7. Launch Mini Program Preview\n- In WeChat Developer Tools, click **Compile**.\n- Navigate to the catalog page to list themes.\n- Start a story to verify mocked responses.\n\n## 8. Telemetry Verification\n- Trigger several story turns.\n- Inspect backend logs or telemetry endpoint to confirm per-turn latency and outcome events are emitted.\n\n## 9. Shutdown\n- Stop the backend dev server.\n- Close WeChat Developer Tools session.\nEOF\n"],"workdir":"/Users/xinge/Desktop/project/Try_4th"})
